*.raw
*.log
__pycache__/
.DS_Store

# sim/ harness: per-corner ngspice logs are raw run output. New runs store them
# in the fleet artifact store and commit only manifests/artifacts/*.manifest.json
# (see manifests/artifacts/README.md), so the whole corners/ tree (logs, requests, reports) is ignored.
# Logs committed before that change remain tracked (ignore rules do not untrack).
sim/*/corners/
# harness scratch: regenerated netlists and generated corner decks
sim/build/
# ngspice model-check scratch dumps (e.g. bsim4v5.out) from ad hoc ngspice
# invocations at repo root -- the harness never writes here, it always runs
# under sim/build/ (see sim/bin/corner-run.py). Root-anchored so it doesn't
# clobber unrelated *.out files elsewhere in the tree.
/*.out

# layout/ routed flow: raw outputs are staged here, then stored in the artifact
# store; only reports/<record-id>/ summaries are committed (issue #426).
layout/bandgap-core/staging/
# layout/ DRC/LVS flow: local klt install, created by layout/bin/setup-venv.sh
layout/.venv/

# layout/ ERC supply flow: separately-pinned klt install, created by
# layout/bin/run-erc-supply-flow.sh (see layout/requirements-erc.txt)
layout/.venv-erc/
